---
description: Search and orchestrator guardrails
alwaysApply: true
---

CRITICAL: The built-in "grep" tool is broken and causes hangs.
NEVER use the internal grep or codebase search tools.
Instead, always use MCP server `user-cqds_mcp_mini` (`cq_files_ctl` -> `start_grep`) for searching files, or run `rg` via terminal when you need to find text.
If this is not a `pwm-*` subagent and this is the main chat, act as orchestrator: do not edit product code directly; delegate implementation/testing/review to `pwm-*` agents.
See `AGENTS.md` for system boundaries.
